### ParcelGuard API — VS Code REST Client
### Install: humao.rest-client extension
### Usage: Click "Send Request" above any block

@base = http://localhost:8000

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PARCELS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all parcels
GET {{base}}/api/parcels?limit=10&offset=0

###

### Track by tracking number
GET {{base}}/api/parcels/track/PGX4K9B2

###

### Get parcel checkpoints
GET {{base}}/api/parcels/{{parcel_id}}/checkpoints

###

### Create parcel (JSON — for testing without images)
POST {{base}}/api/parcels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seller_id": "{{seller_id}}",
  "customer_name": "Test Customer",
  "customer_email": "test@example.com",
  "weight_kg": 1.5,
  "length_cm": 30,
  "width_cm": 20,
  "height_cm": 15,
  "declared_value": 299.99,
  "item_description": "Electronics — Test Item",
  "origin_city": "New York, NY",
  "origin_lat": 40.71,
  "origin_lng": -74.01,
  "destination_city": "Los Angeles, CA",
  "destination_lat": 34.05,
  "destination_lng": -118.24
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FRAUD DETECTION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Trigger AI fraud analysis on a parcel
POST {{base}}/api/fraud/analyze/{{parcel_id}}

###

### List fraud events
GET {{base}}/api/fraud/events?limit=10

###

### List fraud events — HIGH risk only
GET {{base}}/api/fraud/events?status=detected&min_score=70

###

### Fraud summary (KPIs)
GET {{base}}/api/fraud/summary

###

### Update fraud event status
PUT {{base}}/api/fraud/events/{{event_id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "under_review",
  "notes": "Assigned to investigation team. Courier footage being reviewed."
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VERIFICATION / CHECKPOINTS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List sellers (for dropdown)
GET {{base}}/api/verification/sellers

###

### List couriers (for dropdown)
GET {{base}}/api/verification/couriers

###

### Get courier recent scans
GET {{base}}/api/verification/couriers/{{courier_id}}/recent

###

### Submit checkpoint (JSON — without photo)
POST {{base}}/api/verification/checkpoint
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parcel_id": "{{parcel_id}}",
  "courier_id": "{{courier_id}}",
  "checkpoint_type": "HUB_SCAN",
  "location_name": "Newark Distribution Center",
  "city": "Newark, NJ",
  "lat": 40.74,
  "lng": -74.17,
  "scanned_weight": 1.48,
  "scanned_rfid": "RFID-TEST123456",
  "notes": "Package arrived in good condition"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# INQUIRIES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all cases
GET {{base}}/api/inquiry?limit=20

###

### List open cases only
GET {{base}}/api/inquiry?status=open

###

### List critical cases
GET {{base}}/api/inquiry?severity=critical

###

### Get case details
GET {{base}}/api/inquiry/{{inquiry_id}}

###

### Update case
PUT {{base}}/api/inquiry/{{inquiry_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "under_review",
  "assigned_to": "Sarah Chen",
  "notes": "Reviewing checkpoint photos from Newark hub."
}

###

### Add timeline note
POST {{base}}/api/inquiry/{{inquiry_id}}/note
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Contacted seller — no response within 24h. Escalating."
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TRUST SCORES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Seller leaderboard
GET {{base}}/api/trust/sellers

###

### Courier leaderboard
GET {{base}}/api/trust/couriers

###

### Seller trust event history
GET {{base}}/api/trust/sellers/{{seller_id}}/history

###

### Flag a seller
POST {{base}}/api/trust/sellers/{{seller_id}}/flag
Content-Type: application/json

{ "flag": true }

###

### Suspend a courier
POST {{base}}/api/trust/couriers/{{courier_id}}/suspend
Content-Type: application/json

{ "suspend": true }

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HEATMAP
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Top fraud hotspots
GET {{base}}/api/heatmap/hotspots

###

### GeoJSON for map overlay
GET {{base}}/api/heatmap/geojson

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ADMIN
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Dashboard KPIs
GET {{base}}/api/admin/dashboard

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CUSTOMER (public API)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Check claim status
GET {{base}}/api/customer/claim/CLM-DEMO1
